  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation support for IFDK Africa Facility to prepare the Africa Facility programme design</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation support for IFDK Africa Facility to prepare the Africa Facility programme design.  

The Africa Facility aims to support economic growth, employment creation, and development in African countries through increased investments and strengthened commercial engagement between Africa and Denmark. The Facility will deliver 12&#x2013;16 investments and promote economic and social inclusion by building on African and Danish partnerships. It provides risk capital across a range of investment stages, complemented by technical assistance, while addressing information gaps and risk perceptions that constrain Danish investments and commercial partnerships in African markets.</narrative>
  </description>
